            "body": "<html>\n  <body>\n    <p>Dear Pinkal,</p>\n    <p>Thank you for your email regarding your doubt about WhatsApp configuration in n8n. I would be happy to assist you.</p>\n    <p>Could you please provide more specific details about the issue you are facing? For example, are you having trouble setting up the WhatsApp Business API, configuring credentials, or building the workflow in n8n?</p>\n    <p>In general, configuring WhatsApp in n8n involves the following steps:</p>\n    <ol>\n      <li>Obtain WhatsApp Business API credentials from your provider.</li>\n      <li>Set up an HTTP Request node in n8n with the correct API endpoint.</li>\n      <li>Authenticate the node with your access token.</li>\n      <li>Create workflows to send or receive WhatsApp messages as needed.</li>\n    </ol>\n    <p>For example, to send a WhatsApp message, you can configure the HTTP Request node like this:</p>\n    <pre>\n{\n  \"method\": \"POST\",\n  \"url\": \"https://graph.facebook.com/v13.0/your_phone_number_id/messages\",\n  \"headers\": {\n    \"Authorization\": \"Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN\",\n    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n  },\n  \"body\": {\n    \"messaging_product\": \"whatsapp\",\n    \"to\": \"recipient_phone_number\",\n    \"type\": \"text\",\n    \"text\": {\n      \"body\": \"Hello from n8n!\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n    </pre>\n    <p>Please let me know the exact details of your doubt so I can provide more precise assistance.</p>\n    <p>Best regards,<br/>Your Name</p>\n  </body>\n</html>"
